<title>USA: Alden says delisted from Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Alden says delisted from Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alden Electronics Inc said it received notice from Nasdaq that the company would be delisted from the Nasdaq Small-Cap Market on January 13, 1997.</p>
<p>Nasdaq cited the company's failure to meet the minimum bid continuing listing requirements.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
